    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Miracles both magical and mechanical buckle before your might</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Counterspell<sup>SoP</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can attempt to use any of your Counterspell feats on technological equipment as if it were magical equipment. Treat a technological item’s MSD as if it were 11+the item’s level or the item’s craft DC -5.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/technomancy\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
